# Launch checklist

Tick each item. The count and the percentage follow your boxes. Trust this document to turn the boxes on.

:state design = false
:state copy = false
:state ship = false

:checkbox design
- Design approved

:checkbox copy
- Copy written

:checkbox ship
- Shipped

:computed left = 3 - design - copy - ship
:computed raw = (3 - left) * 100 / 3
:computed percent = raw - raw % 1

Left to do: { left } of 3. Progress: { percent }%.

Ticks are temporary preview state. Saving the document saves the source, not your ticks.
